# Comprehensive Web & Markdown Checklist Contract

- **Contract ID**: `SC-CHECKLIST-001`
- **Domain**: Web Ingress, Documentation Integrity, and Formal Quality Assurance
- **Authority**: UOS Canonical Policy / Operator Directive (`contracts/rules/comprehensive-checklist-contract.md`)
- **Tailscale FQDN Link**: [http://nas-1.tail55d152.ts.net:4100/checklist](http://nas-1.tail55d152.ts.net:4100/checklist)
- **Status**: ACTIVE & ENFORCED ACROSS ALL WEBPAGES & MARKDOWN FILES

---

## 1. Operator Mandate

Per explicit operator directive:
> **"create comprehensive checklist that has to be on evey webpage and md file. full site navigation and uniform cohesive structire of full site should there. review zigvm and indrajaal as references. collect and unify all rules and aspects."**

This contract establishes the mandatory, uniform quality and verification checklist that MUST be present on every webpage served over the web and every generated or viewed Markdown document across UOS.

---

