## 3. Uniform Cohesive Site Structure Mandate

All web surfaces MUST share a cohesive, uniform architecture:
1. **Unified Sidebar**: Persistent links to Cockpit Home, Planning, Testing Spec, Wiki Index, ZK Master MOC, KM Hub, File Explorer, AG-UI Stream, and Health API.
2. **Top Status Bar**: Live Tailscale FQDN URL with Click-to-Copy, SIL-6 fractal badge, Zero-Muda badge, and hardware drive interlock indicator.
3. **Interactive Checklist Accordion**: Present on every page, allowing instant inspection and verification of all 18 checklist items.
4. **Dual View Mode**: On every document view, toggle seamlessly between "Rendered Markdown" and "Raw Source".
5. **Persistent Footer**: Tailscale network base FQDN (`nas-1.tail55d152.ts.net:4100`), peer host link (`vm-1.tail55d152.ts.net:8088`), and OTP 29 BEAM status.
